---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Blackline Development and the way we approach commissioned software and digital services.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About Blackline Development</p>
        <h1>Build deliberately. Keep ownership clear.</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          Blackline Development creates custom software and digital services for individuals, communities and businesses, with an emphasis on maintainability, clear decisions and systems that fit the work they support.
        </p>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-aside">
        <strong>One principle</strong>
        <p>If a simpler solution solves the problem properly, unnecessary complexity is not a feature.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container card-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-index">01</span>
        <h3>Understand first</h3>
        <p>Unknown requirements stay visible until they are resolved. We do not turn assumptions into hidden product decisions.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-index">02</span>
        <h3>Reviewable development</h3>
        <p>Work is structured so meaningful changes can be reviewed, tested and explained before they reach production.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-index">03</span>
        <h3>Separate build from operations</h3>
        <p>Commissioned development and managed subscriptions are separate, so customers are not locked into ongoing Blackline hosting to own what was built.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-index">04</span>
        <h3>Design for the next useful action</h3>
        <p>Interfaces should reduce cognitive load, make important state clear and avoid burying the user under unnecessary controls.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
